{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wanted to play a video game but you got transformed into a dog!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rythm Doggo is a fun, classic platform adventure where you take on the role of a dog and create music as you go. It combines jumping and exploring with beats and rhythm, so your movements and actions match the music making the experience feel fluid and immersive. It blends a rhythm game and an exploration platformer, where what you do shapes both how you move and the music you hear.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/21da77defbbfd63cebe41ad70f56c78b.poster.avif?t=1761315235\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/21da77defbbfd63cebe41ad70f56c78b.webm?t=1761315235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Doggo is all about joyful self-expression and musical discovery. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/88f3a567ef6137a7f7b58d30d25d2c44.poster.avif?t=1761315235\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/88f3a567ef6137a7f7b58d30d25d2c44.webm?t=1761315235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a good pup, sniff around, help fellow canines, and leap to your own beat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/431a5c035a24b6f610d7055d2ac862da.poster.avif?t=1761315235\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/extras/431a5c035a24b6f610d7055d2ac862da.webm?t=1761315235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dog protagonist with localized dialogues in \u201cwoof bark woof\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable worlds with vibrant towns where you can meet other dogs, find quests, and many alternative paths and unique surprise encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Biomes with unique visuals, music, and mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive music that changes based on your gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated Twitch chat interaction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light modding and Steam Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compose-for-me hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret level and more cool stuff\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090240?t=1761315235","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/7e82341069e4dea26a34bca70c7f41505a6c46fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761315235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/a9b97717daec8b3080d246cb8eb082691c9cae0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761315235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090240/a9b97717daec8b3080d246cb8eb082691c9cae0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761315235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wanted to play a video game but you got